></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whenever you're stuck, Laika, your robo-dog companion, is ready to guide you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > gently toward the best move</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Break Your Records</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820000/extras/311f844d7d676e3e35e876c9b3724be6.poster.avif?t=1768594790\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820000/extras/311f844d7d676e3e35e876c9b3724be6.webm?t=1768594790\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820000/extras/311f844d7d676e3e35e876c9b3724be6.mp4?t=1768594790\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep track of your improvement with our intuitive scoring and leaderboard system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Challenge yourself to achieve higher scores and climb the ranks.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your loyal robo-dog assistant</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820000/extras/f4cf26e04db65be49e07a69b9c605824.poster.avif?t=1768594790\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820000/extras/f4cf26e04db65be49e07a69b9c605824.webm?t=1768594790\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820000/extras/f4cf26e04db65be49e07a69b9c605824.mp4?t=1768594790\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet Laika \u2014 your friendly, no-judgment guide through the academy. She\u2019s here </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >to help even if you\u2019ve never moved a piece before. No sarcasm, just support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Artistic Style:</strong> Inspired by retro-futurism, Atomic Age aesthetics, and Soviet realism, BOT.VINNIK offers a distinctive visual experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extensive Chess Puzzles:</strong> Solve thousands of \u201cfind the best move\u201d challenges to test and expand your skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Continuously Expanding Content:</strong> Frequent DLCs bring fresh content covering essential chess topics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Competitive Scoring and Leaderboards:</strong> Track your performance, set personal records, and see how you rank.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Helpful Hints from Laika:</strong> Accessible assistance ensures players of all skill levels can enjoy and progress without frustration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beginner Mode:</strong> A dedicated mode for players who\u2019ve never played chess, teaching basic moves and fundamental concepts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Difficulty Levels:</strong> Customize your experience with easy, medium, and hard puzzles according to your skill and ambition.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Deep Green Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820000/0c5dbffb35ceb69446c9fa7734b91954e74d20d4/header.jpg?t=1768594790","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movi